  ProjectName: 360 Environments
  ClientName: Essani
  Tags: 72
  Texts:
  - category: 0
    info: Lead Developer.
  - category: 1
    info: 'Essani specializes in custom lighting products and services for the furniture
      and architecture industries, and for industrial automation.

      

'
  - category: 2
    info: "A WebGL lighting configurator. Users explore 360\xB0 environments (a factory,
      a house and a store) and switch between lighting setups, with the scene updating
      to match the selected lighting.\r\n\r\n"
  - category: 3
    info: "Build size and load time. WebGL apps are downloaded in the browser, and
      the high-resolution 360\xB0 images made the build heavy.\r\n\r\n"
  - category: 9
    info: '- Audited the image assets and found many were imported at far higher
      quality than the screen could show.

      - Halving the quality on those
      assets significantly reduced the build size and made the app run more smoothly,
      with almost no visible difference.'
